&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;|&lt;span style=&quot;white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;|-&amp;nbsp;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 128, 0), rgb(255, 128, 0));&quot;&gt;std_chrono&lt;/font&gt;.&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 128, 0); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;hpp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;|&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;|-&amp;nbsp;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 153, 255), rgb(51, 153, 255));&quot;&gt;concepts&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;|-&amp;nbsp;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 153, 255), rgb(51, 153, 255));&quot;&gt;type_traits&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="AAKn3JwIwb8s-OrhhNjA-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-5400" y="-940" width="290" height="960" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xH16SreHJdYoH5N0sEF3-0" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTES&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;gt; &lt;b&gt;How does the &lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 153, 255), rgb(51, 153, 255));&quot;&gt;Datetime Abstraction Protocol&lt;/font&gt; (&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(199, 146, 234), rgb(199, 146, 234));&quot;&gt;DAP&lt;/font&gt;)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;fit into all of this? (&lt;i&gt;the revised DAP&lt;/i&gt;)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;b&gt; &lt;/b&gt;(Now you can specify what calendar you use?)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt; (The whole point of this is to separate the time&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; keeping mechanism from the datetime API)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;gt; &lt;b&gt;What does the &lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 217, 102), rgb(255, 217, 102));&quot;&gt;StandardDatetimeAPI&lt;/font&gt; look like?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;You provide a calendar and I use it to convert your&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;datetime into a (changeable) representation that&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;can be algebraically accessed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt; &lt;b&gt;The datetime conversion algorithm (the&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;changeable part)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;goes through the user-&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;specified calendar to aqcuire a unified&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;datetime representation to begin conversion&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt; &lt;b&gt;How are you balancing the responsibilities between&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 217, 102), rgb(255, 217, 102));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;StandardDatetimeAPI &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(a.k.a. Datetime) and the &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 217, 102), rgb(255, 217, 102));&quot;&gt;Date&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;/&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 217, 102), rgb(255, 217, 102));&quot;&gt;Time&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; pair?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;gt; &lt;b&gt;Durations are closely associated with the underlying&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;conversion representation. (&lt;i&gt;if you care about performance&lt;/i&gt;)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt; &lt;b&gt;Standardization (not a word) of Durations is REQUIRED!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;gt; &lt;b&gt;Everything is UTC time by default (no timezones)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt; (&lt;i&gt;Timezones introduced later as an additional layer&lt;/i&gt;)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="AAKn3JwIwb8s-OrhhNjA-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1890" y="-2090" width="380" height="410" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
